{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">秀茂坪有的士失事撞倒一名途人，的士司機被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在上午近10時，涉事的士沿寶琳路上斜，往將軍澳方向行駛至寶達商場對開，撞倒正過馬路的45歲男途人，事主頭部、手和腳受傷，送往伊利沙伯醫院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.LT-1700_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026sRSGpENIu41789381444.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.LT-1700_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">45歲男的士司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕，獲准保釋候查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T10:38:16.697913+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}